 "summary": "The atlas change for Sobolev (0,1)-forms and the atlas-independence index theorems have no existing counterpart in Mathlib or TauCeti, and they reuse the existing changeAtlas, atlasEquiv, transfer, density and index lemmas. Building zeroOneAtlasEquiv from two restricted maps follows the repo's pattern (zeroOneTransportEquivL, ZeroOneForm/Prod); ContinuousLinearEquiv.ofSubmodules is not a direct replacement, because the one-directional zeroOneChangeAtlas is needed on its own.",
